{
"section": "Legal and Compliance",
"title": "Privacy Policy",
"body": "Vaultique Boutique respects your privacy and is committed to protecting the personal information you share with us. This policy explains what we collect, why we collect it and how we look after it. We handle personal data in line with the Data Protection Act No. 3 of 2021 of Zambia.\nInformation we collect\n• Contact details you provide, such as your name, phone number, email and delivery address.\n• Order details, including the items you enquire about or purchase.\n• Messages you send us through WhatsApp, email or our website forms.\n• Limited technical information collected automatically by the website, such as general usage data.\nHow we use your information\n• To process and deliver your orders.\n• To respond to your enquiries and provide customer support.\n• To send you updates, offers or newsletters where you have agreed to receive them.\n• To improve our products, website and service.\nWe do not sell your personal information. We share it only with trusted parties who help us operate, such as delivery partners and payment providers, and only to the extent needed to serve you. You may ask us at any time to access, correct or delete the personal information we hold about you by contacting vaultiqueboutique@outlook.com.",
