"section": "Promotions",
"title": "Promotions and Discounts Policy",
"body": "From time to time we offer promotions, discounts and special offers to thank our customers and to celebrate new arrivals and seasons.\n• Each promotion applies only for its stated period and while stocks last.\n• Unless stated otherwise, promotions cannot be combined with other offers or discounts.\n• Promotional prices are confirmed at the point of order.\n• We reserve the right to amend or end a promotion, and to correct any pricing error, before an order is confirmed.\nSpecific terms for each offer are stated when the promotion is announced.",
