},
{
"section": "Promotions",
"title": "Loyalty Rewards Policy",
"body": "We believe loyal customers deserve to be recognised. Our loyalty rewards let you earn benefits as you shop with us.\n• You may earn loyalty points or rewards on qualifying purchases.\n• Rewards can be redeemed against future purchases in line with the terms in force at the time.\n• Points and rewards have no cash value and cannot be transferred or sold.\n• We may update the rewards from time to time, and any change will be communicated to members.\nAsk us how to join and start earning rewards on your purchases.",
