{
"section": "Promotions",
"title": "Seasonal Sale Terms",
"body": "During seasonal sales we offer selected items at reduced prices for a limited time.\n• Sale prices apply only during the stated sale period and while stocks last.\n• Sale items remain subject to our standard quality guarantee and your statutory rights.\n• Some items may be marked final sale, in which case they are not returnable except where faulty.\n• Where a return is allowed on a sale item, any refund is based on the price actually paid.\nSeasonal sales are a wonderful opportunity to enjoy our pieces at special prices, so do shop early for the best choice.",
