{
"section": "Marketing and Communications",
"title": "Newsletter Policy",
"body": "Our newsletter brings you new arrivals, styling ideas and exclusive offers directly.\n• You receive the newsletter only if you have subscribed.\n• We use your contact details solely to send the updates you signed up for.\n• You can unsubscribe at any time by telling us, and we will remove you promptly.\n• We do not share your details with third parties for their own marketing.\nSubscribing is the easiest way to stay ahead of new collections and special offers.",
"sort": 540
