{
"section": "Marketing and Communications",
"title": "SMS and WhatsApp Communication Policy",
"body": "WhatsApp and SMS are central to how we serve you, both for orders and, where you agree, for updates.\n• We use WhatsApp to confirm orders, arrange payment and delivery, and answer your questions.\n• We send promotional messages only to customers who have agreed to receive them.\n• You can opt out of marketing messages at any time while still receiving messages about your orders.\n• We will not share your number with third parties for their own marketing.\nOur official order line is +260 978 323 036 and our general enquiry line is +260 963 539 728.",
"sort": 550
},
{
"section": "Marketing and Communications",
"title": "Social Media Policy",
"body": "We use social media to showcase our products, share styling inspiration and connect with our community.\n• Our official accounts are the only ones authorised to represent Vaultique Boutique.\n• We welcome comments and messages and aim to engage respectfully and helpfully.\n• We may remove content that is abusive, misleading or inappropriate from our pages.\n• Always confirm offers and prices with us directly before ordering, as social posts may not always be current.\nBe aware of imitation accounts. If in doubt, contact us on +260 963 539 728 to confirm an account is genuine.",
"sort": 560
},
{
"section": "Marketing and Communications",
"title": "Reviews and Testimonials Policy",
"body": "Honest reviews help other customers and help us improve. We welcome your feedback on your experience.\n• Reviews and testimonials should reflect genuine experiences with our products or service.\n• With your permission, we may share your testimonial on our website or channels.\n• We may use a first name and general location only, and never your full personal details, without consent.\n• We do not publish false reviews, and we do not remove genuine constructive feedback simply because it is critical.\nThank you for sharing your experience and helping others shop with confidence.",
