"sort": 580
},
{
"section": "Business Information",
"title": "Delivery Coverage Areas",
"body": "We are proud to serve customers throughout Zambia.\n• We deliver nationwide wherever a reliable courier or transport route is available.\n• Delivery to major towns and cities is usually the quickest and most affordable.\n• Deliveries to more remote areas are arranged according to the available routes, with cost and timing confirmed in advance.\n• Collection by appointment is available as an alternative anywhere we operate.\nIf you are unsure whether we deliver to your area, just ask and we will confirm the options and cost.",
"sort": 590
