{
"section": "Business Information",
"title": "Payment Instructions",
"body": "Paying for your order is straightforward. Once your order is confirmed, we send you the exact amount due and the official payment details.\nHow to pay\n• Choose Airtel Money, MTN Money, bank transfer or cash on collection or delivery where available.\n• Use only the official numbers and account details we provide to you directly.\n• Send us the transaction confirmation or reference so we can verify your payment.\n• Once payment is verified, we prepare your order for delivery or collection.\nIf you are ever unsure whether payment details are genuine, contact us on +260 963 539 728 before paying.",
