{
"section": "Special Services",
"title": "Lay-by Policy",
"body": "Our lay-by service lets you secure an item now and pay for it in agreed instalments over time, so you can plan your purchase comfortably.\n• A lay-by is arranged on selected items by agreement, usually with an initial deposit.\n• The item is reserved for you while you complete the agreed instalments.\n• The item is released to you once the full price has been paid.\n• Lay-by terms, including the deposit, the instalment schedule and the completion period, are agreed and confirmed in writing before you begin.\nIf a lay-by is not completed\nIf instalments are not completed within the agreed period, please talk to us. Depending on the circumstances, the item may be returned to stock and amounts paid may be refunded or applied as a credit, subject to a reasonable handling charge that will be explained to you in advance. To start a lay-by, message us on WhatsApp at +260 978 323 036.",
"sort": 610
},
{
"section": "Special Services",
"title": "Personal Shopping Policy",
"body": "For customers who would like guidance, our personal shopping service offers tailored recommendations to suit your taste, occasion and budget.\n• Tell us what you are looking for, your sizes and your preferences, and we will curate a selection for you.\n• We can advise on styling, sizing and how to combine pieces.\n• This service is offered through WhatsApp at a time that suits you.\n• There is no obligation to buy, and you decide what, if anything, to purchase.\nTo arrange personal shopping assistance, message us on WhatsApp at +260 978 323 036.",
